    "detailed_description": "<h1>\u2b50\ufe0fCARDS AND BADGES\u2b50\ufe0f</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830910/extras/9fd2f689c0da5d65b43b6df73362dbbd.avif?t=1744984043\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830910/extras/877ca5b2f29bee6baad7140da374acd8.avif?t=1744984043\" /></div><br><br>You just want to buy milk, but fate loves to slip adventures where you don't expect it. On the farm, you will meet a milkmaid who will make you play the game by her rules. Play the puzzle with the milkmaid. This is the only way you can get her milk.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\u0421omics story<br></li><li>Puzzle game<br></li><li>Beautiful artwork<br></li><li>Animated characters <br></li><li>Relaxing music<br></li><li>CG Gallery Mode<br><br>Easy win:<br>Keyboard \u0421trl+D - Complete Level<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830910/extras/d53a9612433a212f4bcf251641cfe53f.poster.avif?t=1744984043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830910/extras/d53a9612433a212f4bcf251641cfe53f.webm?t=1744984043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830910/extras/d53a9612433a212f4bcf251641cfe53f.mp4?t=1744984043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>In the game, your goal is to collect the puzzle in order to restore the pictures.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830910/extras/764aa1c2727e44112291d91e0a2d32d6.avif?t=1744984043\" /></div></li></ul>",
